{"format":"kane-fabric-administrative-descriptor","format_version":1,"descriptor_id":"us.il.condominium.complaints","descriptor_version":1,"title":"Illinois Condominium — Complaint Procedure & Ombudsperson","help":"Statewide Illinois condominium complaint-policy and Ombudsperson framework. Statutory policy contents, response timing, eligibility boundaries, and Ombudsperson request requirements are Infrastructure; association procedures, complaint records, determinations, and request evidence are association-instance data.","scope":{"country_code":"US","state_code":"IL","label":"Illinois statewide condominium infrastructure","applies_to":"condominium_complaint_and_ombudsperson_process","as_of_date":"2026-09-17","admission_rule":"Only current-effective statewide Illinois condominium complaint-policy and Ombudsperson requirements are Infrastructure. Association-specific complaint forms, delivery channels, internal timelines, case records, determinations, and participant evidence are association-instance data. The Condominium and Common Interest Community Ombudsperson Act and Condominium Property Act Section 35 are currently scheduled to be repealed January 1, 2029."},"categories":[{"id":"complaints.policy","label":"Association complaint policy"},{"id":"complaints.cases","label":"Complaint cases"},{"id":"complaints.ombudsperson","label":"Ombudsperson assistance"},{"id":"complaints.confidentiality","label":"Department confidentiality"}],"authorities":[{"id":"il-condo-act-35","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/35","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K35","summary":"Requires every condominium unit owners' association to comply with the Condominium and Common Interest Community Ombudsperson Act; scheduled repeal January 1, 2029."},{"id":"il-ombudsperson-act-5","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 615/5","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506150K5","summary":"Makes the Ombudsperson Act applicable to all condominium associations governed by the Condominium Property Act."},{"id":"il-ombudsperson-act-35","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 615/35","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506150K35","summary":"Requires a written association complaint policy and specifies policy contents and final-determination timing."},{"id":"il-ombudsperson-act-40","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 615/40","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506150K40","summary":"Establishes unit-owner eligibility and submission requirements for Ombudsperson dispute-resolution assistance."},{"id":"il-ombudsperson-act-45","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 615/45","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506150K45","summary":"Provides confidentiality rules for information collected by the Department under the Ombudsperson Act."}],"pages":[{"id":"complaint-procedure-ombudsperson","title":"Complaint Procedure & Ombudsperson","help":"The statewide framework defines the required complaint policy and the statutory path to Ombudsperson assistance. The association-instance controls record local procedure and evidence without inferring whether a dispute qualifies.","sections":[{"id":"statewide-complaint-framework","title":"Statewide complaint and Ombudsperson framework","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-35","il-ombudsperson-act-5","il-ombudsperson-act-35","il-ombudsperson-act-40","il-ombudsperson-act-45"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"ombudsperson-applicability","kind":"notice","text":"Every condominium unit owners' association is subject to the Condominium and Common Interest Community Ombudsperson Act. The current statutory framework is scheduled to be repealed January 1, 2029.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-35","il-ombudsperson-act-5"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"written-policy-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Each condominium association must adopt a written policy for resolving complaints made by unit owners and must make that policy available to all unit owners upon request.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-35"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"policy-required-components","kind":"notice","text":"The written policy must include a sample complaint form, the process for delivering complaints to the association, the association's timeline and manner for making final determinations, and the required form and timing of the final determination.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-35"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"final-determination-rule","kind":"notice","text":"The association's final determination must be in writing, made within 180 days after receipt of the unit owner's original complaint, and marked clearly and conspicuously as \"final\".","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-35"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"new-association-policy-deadline","kind":"notice","text":"An association first created after January 1, 2019 must establish and adopt the required complaint policy within 180 days following creation.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-35"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"policy-deficiency-boundary","kind":"notice","text":"A unit owner may not use Section 40 assistance solely to challenge the lack or inadequacy of the association's written complaint policy, but may notify the Department in writing of that lack or inadequacy.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-35"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"ombudsperson-assistance-scope","kind":"notice","text":"Subject to appropriation, Ombudsperson dispute-resolution assistance is available only to unit owners for disputes with an association involving alleged violations of the Condominium Property Act or Common Interest Community Association Act. Requests involving community association managers or matters already pending in court, an administrative tribunal, arbitration, or alternative dispute resolution are outside this assistance path.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-40"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"ombudsperson-eligibility-rule","kind":"notice","text":"For a request following a final adverse association decision, the unit owner must satisfy the statutory eligibility conditions, including the outstanding-balance exception, a dispute initiated within the preceding 2 calendar years, prior use of the association complaint policy, receipt of a final adverse decision marked \"final\", and filing the Ombudsperson request within 30 days after receipt of that decision.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-40"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"no-final-response-rule","kind":"notice","text":"If the association has not provided a response marked \"final\" within a reasonable time, an otherwise eligible unit owner may request Ombudsperson assistance no earlier than 90 days after submitting the initial written complaint; the Ombudsperson may still determine that a reasonable time has not passed.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-40"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"ombudsperson-request-package-rule","kind":"notice","text":"A request for assistance must be written on the Office's electronic form and include the statutory submission items, including owner and association contact information, governing documents unless their absence is central to the dispute, complaint-policy and complaint copies, proof of unit ownership, and the final adverse decision if applicable.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-40"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":5,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"mutual-participation-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Ombudsperson assistance is limited to opposing parties who mutually agree to participate, and a unit owner is limited to one request for assistance per dispute.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-40"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":5,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"department-confidentiality-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Information collected by the Department under the Ombudsperson Act is maintained for confidential Department use subject to the statutory exceptions; a request for information to the Department or Ombudsperson under the Act is not a Freedom of Information Act request.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-45"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":5,"column":10,"span":3}}]},{"id":"association-complaint-policy","title":"Association complaint-policy configuration","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-35"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"complaint-policy-reference","kind":"text","label":"Written complaint-policy reference","binding":"association.complaints.policy_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-policy-adopted-date","kind":"date","label":"Policy adopted / last amended","binding":"association.complaints.policy_adopted_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-form-reference","kind":"text","label":"Sample complaint-form reference","binding":"association.complaints.form_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-delivery-process","kind":"textarea","label":"Complaint delivery process","binding":"association.complaints.delivery_process","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-response-timeline","kind":"textarea","label":"Association response timeline / manner","binding":"association.complaints.response_timeline","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-final-decision-role","kind":"text","label":"Final-determination role / contact","binding":"association.complaints.final_decision_role","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-policy-access-method","kind":"textarea","label":"How owners obtain the policy","binding":"association.complaints.policy_access_method","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-policy-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Policy notes / evidence reference","binding":"association.complaints.policy_notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":8}}]},{"id":"association-complaint-cases","title":"Association complaint cases","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-35","il-ombudsperson-act-40"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"complaint-cases","kind":"collection","label":"Complaint cases","binding":"association.complaints.cases","min_items":0,"item_label":"Complaint","actions":{"add_label":"Add complaint","remove_label":"Remove complaint"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"complaint-case-id","kind":"text","label":"Complaint reference","binding":"complaint_reference","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"complaint-unit-reference","kind":"text","label":"Association-local unit reference","binding":"unit_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"complaint-owner-reference","kind":"text","label":"Association-local owner reference","binding":"owner_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"complaint-received-date","kind":"date","label":"Complaint received","binding":"received_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"complaint-alleged-authority","kind":"textarea","label":"Alleged statutory / governing-document issue","binding":"alleged_authority","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-document-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Original complaint / evidence reference","binding":"complaint_document_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-status","kind":"select","label":"Observed status","binding":"status","options":[{"value":"received","label":"Received"},{"value":"under_review","label":"Under review"},{"value":"final_favorable","label":"Final — favorable / non-adverse"},{"value":"final_adverse","label":"Final — adverse"},{"value":"closed_other","label":"Closed — other"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"complaint-final-date","kind":"date","label":"Final determination date","binding":"final_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"complaint-final-marked","kind":"checkbox","label":"Determination visibly marked \"final\"","binding":"final_marked","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"complaint-final-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Final determination reference","binding":"final_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"complaint-department-policy-notice","kind":"checkbox","label":"Department notified of policy deficiency, if applicable","binding":"department_policy_deficiency_notice","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"complaint-case-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Case notes / chronology reference","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":12}}]}]},{"id":"ombudsperson-assistance-records","title":"Ombudsperson assistance records","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-40","il-ombudsperson-act-45"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"ombudsperson-requests","kind":"collection","label":"Ombudsperson assistance requests","binding":"association.complaints.ombudsperson_requests","min_items":0,"item_label":"Assistance request","actions":{"add_label":"Add assistance request","remove_label":"Remove assistance request"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"ombudsperson-complaint-reference","kind":"text","label":"Complaint reference","binding":"complaint_reference","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"ombudsperson-request-date","kind":"date","label":"Request submitted","binding":"request_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"ombudsperson-request-basis","kind":"select","label":"Observed request basis","binding":"request_basis","options":[{"value":"final_adverse_decision","label":"Final adverse decision"},{"value":"no_final_response_after_90_days","label":"No final response after at least 90 days"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"ombudsperson-dispute-start-date","kind":"date","label":"Dispute initiated / first occurred","binding":"dispute_start_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"ombudsperson-balance-status","kind":"select","label":"Outstanding-balance condition","binding":"balance_status","options":[{"value":"none","label":"No outstanding amount observed"},{"value":"central_to_dispute","label":"Outstanding amount central to dispute"},{"value":"other_outstanding","label":"Other outstanding amount observed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"ombudsperson-final-decision-date","kind":"date","label":"Final adverse decision received","binding":"final_decision_received_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"ombudsperson-package-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Request package / evidence reference","binding":"package_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"ombudsperson-manager-dispute","kind":"checkbox","label":"Dispute directed at manager / management firm","binding":"manager_dispute","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"ombudsperson-pending-proceeding","kind":"checkbox","label":"Court / tribunal / arbitration / ADR proceeding pending or previously scheduled","binding":"pending_or_prior_proceeding","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"ombudsperson-mutual-participation","kind":"select","label":"Mutual participation","binding":"mutual_participation","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Both parties agreed"},{"value":"no","label":"Mutual agreement not observed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"ombudsperson-request-status","kind":"select","label":"Observed request status","binding":"status","options":[{"value":"prepared","label":"Prepared"},{"value":"submitted","label":"Submitted"},{"value":"accepted_for_assistance","label":"Accepted for assistance"},{"value":"declined","label":"Declined"},{"value":"resolved","label":"Resolved / closed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"ombudsperson-request-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Request / resolution notes","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":12}}]},{"id":"ombudsperson-no-eligibility-inference","kind":"notice","text":"Recorded association-instance fields document observed evidence only. The descriptor does not determine statutory eligibility, whether a final decision is adverse, whether a reasonable time has passed, or whether the Department will accept or resolve a request.","authority_refs":["il-ombudsperson-act-40"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":12}}]}]}]}